<title>USA: SunSource signs agreement with Tipper Tie.</title>
<headline>SunSource signs agreement with Tipper Tie.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunSource LP said on Wednesday its SIMCO/S-T-M Division signed a partnership agreement with Tipper Tie Inc to implement an inventory management system which is expected to generated annual revenues of $2 million.</p>
<p>SIMCO/S-T-M, based in Lenexa, Kansas, would provide Tipper Tie, a subsidiary of Dover Industries Ltd with inventory management.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
